<title>USA: MSB Financial Inc Q1 Sept 30 net falls.</title>
<headline>MSB Financial Inc Q1 Sept 30 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>MARSHALL, Mich. 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>MSB FINANCIAL INC</p>
<p>		     Consolidated Statement of Income</p>
<p>	   (Dollars in Thousands  except Per Share Data)</p>
<p>						    For three months ended</p>
<p>							Sep 30	 Sep 30</p>
<p>							 1996	    1995</p>
<p> Interest Income				  $1,260	 $1,126</p>
<p> Interest Expense				    492	    396</p>
<p> Net Interest Income				 768	    730</p>
<p> Provision for loan losses			   9		6</p>
<p>Net Interest Income after</p>
<p>    Provision for Loan Losses		    759	    724</p>
<p> Other Income					   54	     77</p>
<p> Other Expenses					485	    428</p>
<p> SAIF Special Assessment			   269		-</p>
<p>Income before Federal</p>
<p>    Income Tax Expense				59	    373</p>
<p> Federal Income Tax Expense			 18	    127</p>
<p> Net Income					     41	    246</p>
<p>Per Share earnings on</p>
<p>    Common Stock				   $0.07	  $0.37</p>
<p>NOTE: Q1 ended September 30, 1996 includes after-tax charge of $171,000, or $0.28 a share, for recapitalization of Federal Deposit Insurance Corp.'s Savings Asociateion Insurance Fund.</p>
